WEBVTT

00:11.400 --> 00:14.200
Thank you so much

00:15.160 --> 00:18.360
for making me be with Hann forever.

00:21.600 --> 00:25.640
Hippo, hippo, hippopotamus

00:25.720 --> 00:27.680
-Oh, my god!
-It ambles

00:27.760 --> 00:29.000
He's the real deal.

00:30.600 --> 00:34.160
Hann is tolerating his evil fans.

00:35.680 --> 00:37.880
This is our school's welcoming ceremony.

00:37.960 --> 00:39.080
-It ambles
-Be careful.

00:39.920 --> 00:42.840
Who will be our next hippopotamus?

00:45.680 --> 00:47.120
-Wow, it's huge
-She's for real.

00:47.200 --> 00:50.000
It ambles

00:50.080 --> 00:52.480
Look at Hann's face. Oh, my god.

00:53.040 --> 00:54.520
Hippo, hippo

00:54.600 --> 00:56.960
The newbies are having fun right now.

00:57.480 --> 01:00.720
It ambles and ambles

01:00.800 --> 01:01.960
What is her name?

01:04.239 --> 01:05.080
What?

01:10.160 --> 01:11.320
It's all right.

01:12.840 --> 01:16.320
-Hippo
-It's so huge

01:16.400 --> 01:17.720
She's cute.

01:18.880 --> 01:20.320
Hann is having so much fun.

01:20.400 --> 01:22.400
Things are getting crazier.
What a fun day!

02:38.680 --> 02:40.200
Thank you very much.

02:40.280 --> 02:42.320
Without your help just now,

02:42.400 --> 02:43.840
it would have been a disaster.

02:43.920 --> 02:44.800
You're welcome.

02:44.880 --> 02:46.840
Hello, there!

02:46.920 --> 02:48.440
-Hey.
-Hello.

02:48.520 --> 02:50.440
Do you two know each other?

02:51.880 --> 02:54.480
-No, we don't.
-You don't? Hang on.

02:55.000 --> 02:57.160
Get out of the way, Top.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.080
What did you say?

02:58.560 --> 03:00.520
Do you two know each other?

03:01.680 --> 03:02.520
We don't.

03:02.600 --> 03:04.760
You don't? You seem close though.

03:05.080 --> 03:07.360
Just now, you looked really close
when you were dancing.

03:08.760 --> 03:11.160
So, what's your name?

03:12.240 --> 03:13.560
-Yes.
-I'm...

03:14.360 --> 03:15.680
Nanno.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.280
Nanno?

03:17.360 --> 03:19.080
Hann and Nanno.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.360
You could be Hanno.

03:21.440 --> 03:22.920
Hanno, right?

03:23.280 --> 03:26.080
Hanno.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.440
Move closer, please.

03:30.760 --> 03:32.320
Big smile for the camera.

03:33.400 --> 03:35.640
Can you do this?

03:36.240 --> 03:37.800
Closer. Put your hands together.

03:37.880 --> 03:38.960
Okay.

03:39.520 --> 03:40.560
Smile.

03:40.640 --> 03:42.880
Say Hanno simultaneously. One, two, three.

03:43.320 --> 03:44.160
-Hanno.
-Hanno.

03:46.000 --> 03:49.280
HANNO
LIKED

03:53.440 --> 03:56.560
OMG! THE FAIRYTALE COUPLE OF THE YEAR.

03:56.640 --> 03:59.640
HANNO ARE SO CUTE.

03:59.720 --> 04:03.520
SO CUTE! SCREAM

04:03.600 --> 04:08.840
AW. MINI-HEART!

04:14.080 --> 04:16.720
SOMEBODY IS JEALOUS.

04:16.800 --> 04:19.200
WHAT A MOOD SPOILER.

04:19.279 --> 04:22.280
GO AWAY IF YOU DON'T LIKE IT!

04:55.600 --> 04:56.560
Hann.

04:59.880 --> 05:01.800
-Yes?
-What are you doing?

05:01.880 --> 05:03.880
You are chatting with Nanno, aren't you?

05:06.480 --> 05:07.960
-I...
-I'll let you send one message.

05:08.520 --> 05:09.440
You should focus.

05:09.520 --> 05:10.920
All right. Back to practice.

05:36.720 --> 05:37.760
Have you been waiting long?

05:39.360 --> 05:40.840
I'm sorry.

05:41.720 --> 05:45.360
It's really hard to avoid
Jer and the fans.

05:45.440 --> 05:46.520
Really?

05:46.600 --> 05:48.600
Are you that popular?

05:48.680 --> 05:49.800
Of course.

05:51.480 --> 05:52.520
-Hey.
-What?

05:52.600 --> 05:54.720
Do you want me to tell Jer for you?

05:54.800 --> 05:58.440
I'll tell him to work on some news
other than this Hann and Nanno story.

05:58.880 --> 05:59.960
Why?

06:00.040 --> 06:01.080
No way.

06:01.400 --> 06:02.800
The Facebook likes will disappear.

06:03.840 --> 06:05.040
Hey.

06:05.120 --> 06:07.280
Are you more interested
in Facebook likes than in me?

06:07.640 --> 06:08.960
Of course.

06:10.800 --> 06:11.800
What did you say?

06:11.880 --> 06:13.200
-Asshole.
-Hey.

06:14.320 --> 06:15.920
I'm kidding.

06:16.480 --> 06:17.640
Seriously, though.

06:18.200 --> 06:19.520
What's the problem?

06:19.600 --> 06:23.240
You like that I have a lot of fans, right?

06:23.320 --> 06:24.800
Don't you feel like,

06:25.240 --> 06:26.320
you know,

06:26.880 --> 06:27.840
you are the winner?

06:27.920 --> 06:29.120
Right?

06:29.200 --> 06:31.920
I might have felt that before,

06:32.000 --> 06:33.840
but with Nanno, it's not the case.

06:33.920 --> 06:35.160
This is different.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.280
How is it different?

06:36.760 --> 06:39.400
It's exactly the same.
Fairytale couple, it sounds cute.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.160
There's nothing more to it.

06:41.720 --> 06:43.160
My soulmate

06:43.240 --> 06:44.720
and the one who loves me the most

06:45.600 --> 06:48.200
is you, Yui.

06:49.080 --> 06:50.000
Okay?

06:50.080 --> 06:51.080
Stop it.

06:51.680 --> 06:52.760
Do you like it?

06:53.560 --> 06:55.080
This line has never failed to impress.

06:55.440 --> 06:56.440
I'm kidding.

06:56.840 --> 06:58.400
Promise me

06:59.120 --> 07:00.960
that nothing will happen

07:01.800 --> 07:03.680
with you and Nanno.

07:05.720 --> 07:06.720
I promise.

07:08.520 --> 07:10.080
Promise me.

07:11.440 --> 07:12.560
Seal it with a kiss.

07:17.680 --> 07:18.560
What's that?

07:25.840 --> 07:26.960
I'll be right back.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.960
Jer, what happened?

07:34.800 --> 07:35.680
Nanno has disappeared.

07:35.760 --> 07:36.680
-What?
-What?

07:36.760 --> 07:38.640
-Damn, what do we do?
-What should we do?

07:38.720 --> 07:40.760
-Let's look around.
-All right.

07:40.840 --> 07:42.640
-Let's split up.
-Let's go.

07:46.160 --> 07:47.800
Today, Nanno has disappeared.

07:47.880 --> 07:50.120
-We are currently looking for her.
-Nanno!

07:50.720 --> 07:52.480
Please send us your support.

07:53.160 --> 07:54.480
-Oh, shit.
-Have you guys seen her?

07:54.560 --> 07:55.440
No.

07:56.240 --> 07:58.240
-Help me! Help!
-Hey!

08:00.240 --> 08:02.440
-Nanno?
-Somebody, help!

08:02.520 --> 08:03.360
Nanno!

08:03.680 --> 08:05.280
-What's the hell?
-Help me.

08:05.360 --> 08:07.200
-It's slippery.
-Watch out. It's slippery.

08:07.600 --> 08:09.520
-Help me! I'm in here.
-Nanno?

08:10.200 --> 08:12.040
-Kick it open!
-Go on!

08:12.120 --> 08:13.520
-Kick it in!
-Kick it in!

08:13.600 --> 08:14.600
Hann?

08:15.200 --> 08:16.120
That hurts. Shit.

08:16.200 --> 08:18.240
-Kick it harder!
-Kick it!

08:18.320 --> 08:19.680
-Damn!
-Right!

08:19.760 --> 08:20.960
-Nanno!
-Yes!

08:24.320 --> 08:25.640
Please let us through.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.040
-Make way, please.
-Let us through.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.520
Please let us through.

08:28.600 --> 08:30.760
-Hey, what's happening?
-Please let us through.

08:30.840 --> 08:32.039
She fainted.

08:35.159 --> 08:36.159
Nanno.

08:36.760 --> 08:37.760
Nanno.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.200
Nanno.

08:42.799 --> 08:44.320
They're hugging.

08:44.840 --> 08:47.920
Nanno must be so grateful for Hann's help.

08:49.120 --> 08:50.800
-Kiss him.
-You're okay now.

08:50.880 --> 08:54.040
-Kiss her!
-Kiss her!

08:54.120 --> 08:55.200
Bang her!

09:03.720 --> 09:04.960
I'm sorry.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.800
I was just happy that I got out.

09:08.800 --> 09:10.200
It's my job.

09:12.800 --> 09:13.880
Hey.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.400
What's wrong? Your hands are shaking.

09:15.920 --> 09:17.280
I'm scared.

09:17.760 --> 09:19.360
The cockroaches

09:19.880 --> 09:21.720
are still stuck in my mind.

09:22.800 --> 09:25.000
Why don't you hold her hands
to soothe her, Hann?

09:25.480 --> 09:27.560
-Hold her hands!
-Hold her hands!

09:27.640 --> 09:29.200
-Hold them!
-Hold them!

09:29.280 --> 09:30.880
-Come on.
-Hold her hands!

09:30.960 --> 09:33.120
We're not a couple.
We should keep our distance.

09:33.640 --> 09:34.640
What?

09:34.720 --> 09:36.800
You're not together? You should be now.

09:36.880 --> 09:40.160
-That's right.
-Get together.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.520
-Hook up.
-Become a couple.

09:41.600 --> 09:42.520
Stop it.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.840
She probably has a boyfriend.

09:44.720 --> 09:46.040
I don't.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.560
Do you have a girlfriend, Hann?

09:55.520 --> 09:56.480
I...

09:57.360 --> 09:58.360
don't either.

10:01.960 --> 10:03.440
Neither of you is in a relationship.

10:03.520 --> 10:04.720
Why don't you date each other?

10:04.800 --> 10:06.680
-Come on!
-Come on!

10:06.760 --> 10:08.360
-Become a couple.
-Hey.

10:08.440 --> 10:09.680
Become a couple.

10:10.720 --> 10:11.880
We shouldn't do that.

10:11.960 --> 10:14.160
You're putting Hann on the spot.

10:14.640 --> 10:16.600
I understand

10:16.680 --> 10:19.720
that we are just another pairing

10:19.800 --> 10:21.200
and will never become real.

10:23.200 --> 10:25.160
Thank you so much for helping me.

10:25.760 --> 10:27.560
I'm going to go now.

10:28.640 --> 10:29.840
Hold on.

10:34.560 --> 10:35.640
What is it?

10:38.040 --> 10:39.160
Will you be my girlfriend?

10:46.840 --> 10:49.200
All right. I will be your girlfriend,

10:51.440 --> 10:53.920
but there's one condition.

10:55.720 --> 10:56.840
What is it?

10:58.000 --> 10:59.720
As my boyfriend,

10:59.800 --> 11:01.640
you can't leave me.

11:04.960 --> 11:09.360
-Hanno!
-Hanno!

11:09.440 --> 11:11.520
-Hanno!
-Hanno!

11:20.960 --> 11:24.640
Nanno is a new student
who's very lively and sweet,

11:24.720 --> 11:26.360
and she gets on well with everyone.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.640
-She's nice.
-Yes, she's nice.

11:27.720 --> 11:29.760
-She's friendly.
-She's adapting very well.

11:29.840 --> 11:32.480
Better than us, even.
We've been here since 7th grade

11:32.560 --> 11:33.920
but we still haven't settled in.

11:34.640 --> 11:36.840
We know that they are together.

11:36.920 --> 11:39.440
If they are showing their love,
it's pretty standard.

11:39.520 --> 11:42.320
Hey, you two. Where you there
when they got together?

11:42.400 --> 11:43.280
-Yes.
-Yes.

11:43.360 --> 11:44.880
We can go inside, right?

11:45.560 --> 11:46.560
Right here.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.720
If they're really a couple,

11:50.800 --> 11:52.640
I would like to offer this poem to them.

11:52.720 --> 11:53.800
Hann and Nanno.

11:53.880 --> 11:56.080
"Nanno, the new girl,

11:56.160 --> 11:58.480
so lively at first glance.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.200
Hann then asks her out

12:01.280 --> 12:03.680
-in the hope for true love."
-Well...

12:03.760 --> 12:09.120
I'm happy for her because
she has Hann all to herself.

12:09.240 --> 12:10.560
I want him for myself.

12:11.320 --> 12:14.560
But Hann and Nanno are a perfect couple.

12:14.640 --> 12:15.880
I love that she's so friendly.

12:15.960 --> 12:18.520
They are the fairytale couple.

12:18.640 --> 12:21.240
Eternal love as promised.

12:21.840 --> 12:24.120
May they never part.

12:24.200 --> 12:26.720
May their love never break.

12:27.240 --> 12:28.440
Great.

12:28.520 --> 12:30.560
Hann, you promised

12:30.640 --> 12:35.640
that you and Nanno
will love each other forever.

12:36.320 --> 12:38.160
-Hello.
-Hello.

12:38.240 --> 12:43.280
These are Hanno's fans. Look at this.

12:43.360 --> 12:47.480
There is a lot of merchandise
on sale today.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.480
Here are some pillows. Look.

12:49.560 --> 12:51.040
How cute.

12:52.720 --> 12:54.920
There are masks as well.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.640
There are also paper fans.

12:58.120 --> 13:00.560
Hanno paper fans. Which one do you choose?

13:01.880 --> 13:03.800
There's bottled water over there.

13:03.880 --> 13:05.000
Yes, water.

13:06.560 --> 13:08.200
-Hello.
-Hello.

13:08.280 --> 13:09.920
What's your name
and what grade are you in?

13:10.000 --> 13:11.680
-I'm Game.
-What grade are you in?

13:11.760 --> 13:12.600
-Grade 12.
-Grade 12?

13:12.680 --> 13:14.680
Why do you look so old? I'm sorry.

13:14.760 --> 13:17.520
What is the first rule
between Nanno and Hann?

13:17.600 --> 13:18.880
"Don't leave."

13:18.960 --> 13:20.960
Once you've bought the item,
you shouldn't leave it.

13:21.040 --> 13:21.920
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:22.000 --> 13:24.000
Keep it safe.

13:33.560 --> 13:34.560
Let's dance.

14:01.640 --> 14:04.080
THIS IS GETTING TOO MUCH.
HOW FAR ARE YOU GOING TO TAKE IT?

14:04.160 --> 14:10.640
IT'S ONLY FOR THE LIKES.
PEOPLE WILL FORGET ABOUT IT.

14:14.320 --> 14:19.760
DID YOU FORGET ABOUT OUR DATE?
I'M ALREADY HERE.

14:24.000 --> 14:25.320
Hello.

14:26.120 --> 14:26.960
Hello.

14:27.040 --> 14:28.280
What are you up to?

14:29.000 --> 14:31.160
Well, why are you here?

14:32.120 --> 14:34.600
-So?
-I had a nightmare.

14:36.120 --> 14:37.160
And...

14:37.560 --> 14:39.760
I want to watch you sleep, so I came.

14:43.560 --> 14:44.760
I see.

14:53.200 --> 14:55.080
Hello.

14:56.560 --> 14:59.120
Top, you're in the frame.
Don't get in the frame.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.840
They are eating.

15:00.920 --> 15:02.560
Today...

15:03.520 --> 15:06.200
I made a lunchbox for Hann.

15:06.280 --> 15:07.360
What do you have?

15:07.440 --> 15:09.240
Here.

15:09.720 --> 15:11.840
Look. That's nice.

15:11.920 --> 15:14.040
There's a sticker. How cute.

15:16.240 --> 15:17.800
It looks delicious.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.120
This one, too.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.960
Which one is delicious?

15:21.080 --> 15:22.800
Let's ask Hann then.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.960
What meat is it?

15:26.040 --> 15:28.760
It's a bit weird.

15:30.280 --> 15:31.520
I'm not telling you.

15:34.040 --> 15:35.520
Open up.

15:39.080 --> 15:40.040
Is it good?

15:40.640 --> 15:42.520
-Yes, it's really good.
-I see.

15:43.080 --> 15:45.800
Please eat a lot. You have to eat it all.

15:45.920 --> 15:48.640
I woke up early to cook them for you.

15:50.720 --> 15:52.320
Do you want to eat some?

15:52.880 --> 15:55.080
No, thank you. I cooked them all for you.

16:01.480 --> 16:02.960
Adjust mask to fit your eyes.

16:03.560 --> 16:05.560
You guys in the masks, look this way.

16:07.600 --> 16:10.600
Hip, hip, hip, hippo

16:10.680 --> 16:12.120
Wow, it's huge

16:12.200 --> 16:15.000
It ambles

16:15.080 --> 16:18.160
La, la, la

16:18.240 --> 16:19.760
Hip, hip

16:22.360 --> 16:24.080
A giant roti

16:24.160 --> 16:26.320
With egg and milk

16:26.400 --> 16:27.840
A round roti

16:27.920 --> 16:29.760
With egg and milk

16:29.840 --> 16:31.560
A giant roti

16:31.640 --> 16:33.240
With egg and milk

16:33.320 --> 16:34.840
A round roti

16:34.920 --> 16:36.680
With milk and egg

16:36.760 --> 16:40.200
Egg

16:40.280 --> 16:43.200
Egg

16:57.720 --> 16:59.200
-Yui.
-What the hell.

16:59.280 --> 17:00.560
I've had enough.

17:01.000 --> 17:01.920
Enough of what?

17:02.000 --> 17:03.560
-Calm down.
-This is too much.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.400
If you don't dump her, we're over.

17:05.480 --> 17:06.920
Just calm down, Yui.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.160
Don't forget
that this was all just an act.

17:11.200 --> 17:12.400
You're my real girlfriend.

17:13.000 --> 17:15.240
-That was a show.
-What kind of show?

17:15.319 --> 17:17.640
We don't get to spend any time together.

17:17.720 --> 17:19.520
And those dance moves you pulled.

17:19.599 --> 17:21.240
Next, you'll make out for everyone to see.

17:21.319 --> 17:23.599
It won't come to that. That's obscene.

17:24.440 --> 17:26.079
Keep your voice down
or they might hear us.

17:26.680 --> 17:28.520
Calm down, okay?

17:29.000 --> 17:31.640
You're the one for me.
What else do you want from me?

17:31.720 --> 17:32.960
I'm not playing anymore.

17:34.040 --> 17:35.640
What the hell?

17:35.720 --> 17:37.200
-I'm not doing this anymore.
-What?

17:37.280 --> 17:39.000
You need to break up with her right now.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.440
But...

17:42.520 --> 17:44.200
-the number of likes--
-What's the matter?

17:44.840 --> 17:46.280
Don't you care about my feelings?

17:55.120 --> 17:56.120
Will you calm down?

17:56.840 --> 17:57.840
Calm down.

18:00.240 --> 18:01.200
All right.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.480
I'll break it off with her.

18:07.320 --> 18:08.360
Give me two days.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.240
Then I'll break it off.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.000
Just two days.

18:14.720 --> 18:15.720
No.

18:16.400 --> 18:18.200
You will break your promise again.

18:20.000 --> 18:21.720
When have I ever broken a promise?

18:23.360 --> 18:24.320
Tell me.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.200
Seal your promise with a kiss.

18:42.280 --> 18:44.200
Where is he?

18:44.280 --> 18:45.920
-Egg.
-Egg.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.240
So...

18:52.680 --> 18:53.960
What's going on here?

18:56.280 --> 18:57.320
Hann...

18:58.040 --> 19:00.360
and Yui...

19:06.320 --> 19:08.760
-Excuse me.
-Hey, Nanno.

19:09.640 --> 19:10.640
Nanno.

19:16.000 --> 19:16.920
Go after her.

19:17.320 --> 19:18.320
Go after her.

19:19.720 --> 19:20.880
-Hann.
-Hurry up.

19:24.240 --> 19:25.200
Nanno!

19:26.240 --> 19:27.200
Nanno!

19:29.760 --> 19:30.800
What are you shooting?

19:31.240 --> 19:32.720
I'm so sorry.

19:32.800 --> 19:33.760
So...

19:34.440 --> 19:36.920
Shall we go after Nanno? Let's go.

20:02.000 --> 20:03.760
Are you and Yui...

20:05.840 --> 20:07.320
in love?

20:11.720 --> 20:13.760
-We---
-You what?

20:15.840 --> 20:17.640
I saw you.

20:24.040 --> 20:25.320
I'll tell you the truth.

20:28.240 --> 20:29.160
Well...

20:31.240 --> 20:32.600
Yui and I are together.

20:50.280 --> 20:51.280
I...

20:51.960 --> 20:53.040
How shall I put it?

20:59.480 --> 21:01.360
I just wanted everyone at school
to be happy.

21:05.240 --> 21:08.360
So I chose to date you

21:12.040 --> 21:14.040
without considering your feelings,

21:14.920 --> 21:16.000
or Yui's.

21:24.000 --> 21:25.120
Since things have been--

21:34.280 --> 21:36.120
Do you really think I'm upset?

21:37.160 --> 21:38.880
Why do I have to be upset?

21:39.960 --> 21:41.560
I have known

21:41.920 --> 21:43.400
that there's something between you two

21:44.640 --> 21:46.640
since my first day at school.

21:48.320 --> 21:50.400
You wanted to become popular

21:50.480 --> 21:52.960
and make the school a happy place,

21:54.800 --> 21:56.200
so I helped.

21:56.960 --> 21:58.160
It's all good, right?

22:04.440 --> 22:05.480
In that case...

22:06.640 --> 22:08.480
-let's break up.
-Break up?

22:12.800 --> 22:14.880
Are you breaking up with me?

22:15.840 --> 22:17.200
Sure, we can break up,

22:17.880 --> 22:19.880
and I'll tell everyone

22:21.000 --> 22:23.080
that you broke my heart.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.000
Yui,

22:28.560 --> 22:31.000
ruined our relationship.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.200
She came between us.

22:36.760 --> 22:38.840
Yui is so cruel.

22:38.920 --> 22:40.800
Oh, what's about this?

22:41.640 --> 22:42.680
Hann...

22:43.480 --> 22:45.680
Hann is such a liar.

22:46.640 --> 22:49.040
He told me that he would never leave me.

22:50.320 --> 22:52.040
But in the end,

22:53.320 --> 22:55.200
he just broke the promise.

22:58.800 --> 23:02.640
It doesn't matter
how I will tell the story.

23:03.840 --> 23:05.120
Your popularity...

23:06.320 --> 23:08.760
-will definitely drop.
-Nanno.

23:08.840 --> 23:09.920
What?

23:10.440 --> 23:13.760
You have other ways to break up with me
without affecting your popularity?

23:15.840 --> 23:16.960
That's good though.

23:17.040 --> 23:18.720
I want to know what you will do.

23:23.200 --> 23:24.800
Good luck with that, Hann.

23:28.880 --> 23:30.400
HANNO

23:30.480 --> 23:33.760
COMPETITION OPEN
FOR NEW HANNO STICKER DESIGN

23:33.840 --> 23:35.360
HERE'S THE FIRST ONE
LOWKEY SLUTTY

23:35.440 --> 23:36.440
WHAT GHOST IS THIS?

23:37.560 --> 23:38.400
I WANT CHICKEN!

23:38.480 --> 23:40.720
WHO PUT THE SALT IN THE HOLE?

23:49.040 --> 23:51.200
Attention please, attention please.

23:51.280 --> 23:56.000
Students who ordered
the Hanno mask volume 2...

23:56.080 --> 23:58.320
PEOPLE AT SCHOOL ARE OUT TO GET ME.

23:58.400 --> 24:00.480
THEY EDITED UGLY PHOTOS OF ME.

24:00.560 --> 24:05.480
THIS IS NO LAUGHING MATTER.
WHAT DO WE DO?

24:08.200 --> 24:13.640
I want to play this song to everyone.

24:23.160 --> 24:25.160
I'M SCREWED, TOO. I GOT PLAYED BY NANNO.

24:25.240 --> 24:28.600
YUI: IF SHE REFUSES TO BREAK UP,
GET THE OTHERS TO PUT PRESSURE ON HER.

24:28.680 --> 24:30.600
HOW?

24:42.240 --> 24:44.400
It looks like they're flirting, right?

24:44.480 --> 24:45.640
It's too far away.

24:45.720 --> 24:47.720
Shit. The geckos are noisy.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.280
Too far.

24:54.280 --> 24:55.760
-Look.
-Yes.

24:56.160 --> 24:57.840
-This is more like it.
-Right.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.760
-Is this okay?
-It's not bad.

25:01.720 --> 25:03.440
-I think this shot is okay.
-Right.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.440
Here, zoom in a bit.

25:09.040 --> 25:09.960
What?

25:10.440 --> 25:11.360
Right.

25:16.920 --> 25:20.520
DO NOT LEAVE THE SCHOOL PREMISES

25:52.040 --> 25:53.040
What are you doing?

25:53.120 --> 25:57.240
What are you doing?

26:47.120 --> 26:48.920
Have you all gone crazy?

26:52.440 --> 26:53.640
I'm warning you guys--

26:57.480 --> 27:02.680
-Hanno!
-Hanno!

27:02.760 --> 27:07.920
-Hanno!
-Hanno!

27:37.960 --> 27:39.280
Give me Nanno's contact details.

27:42.520 --> 27:48.360
DO NOT LEAVE THE SCHOOL PREMISES

28:34.080 --> 28:35.200
What are you doing?

28:36.480 --> 28:37.400
Han!

29:18.480 --> 29:19.640
If she died,

29:25.200 --> 29:26.360
I would simply

29:27.480 --> 29:28.800
pretend to be sad.

29:33.280 --> 29:35.040
Then we would be free.

29:47.760 --> 29:52.960
MEET ME AT THE ROOFTOP. COME ALONE.
HANDSOME HANN

30:36.440 --> 30:37.960
Excuse me.

30:38.560 --> 30:40.280
Oh, my god, Nanno!

30:41.360 --> 30:42.880
Nanno!

30:43.960 --> 30:46.240
Nanno!

30:50.400 --> 30:51.640
What happened?

30:52.480 --> 30:53.360
Nan...

30:53.800 --> 30:54.800
Ambulance!

30:55.320 --> 30:57.520
Somebody call an ambulance!

31:06.040 --> 31:07.640
Why did you do this?

31:08.720 --> 31:09.720
Nanno!

31:15.320 --> 31:16.160
I'm the bad guy.

31:17.600 --> 31:18.800
I'm such a bad guy!

31:19.560 --> 31:20.960
What's done is done.

31:21.040 --> 31:23.200
-Hann.
-It will be all right.

32:42.440 --> 32:43.360
Yui.

32:44.640 --> 32:45.800
You did it.

32:49.640 --> 32:50.640
No, I didn't.

32:51.280 --> 32:52.480
I didn't do it.

32:56.520 --> 32:57.680
What do you mean?

33:03.560 --> 33:05.960
Never mind.

33:06.560 --> 33:08.360
It's over, right?

33:09.960 --> 33:11.400
-Right?
-Yes.

33:13.520 --> 33:15.320
I'm so happy.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.200
I feel like...

33:21.000 --> 33:22.320
I've been reborn.

33:26.000 --> 33:26.960
Hann.

33:28.000 --> 33:30.120
We still need to stick to the plan.

33:32.080 --> 33:33.760
Put on a sad face for a while.

33:36.880 --> 33:38.000
And I...

33:38.640 --> 33:40.240
will ordain as a nun in honor of her.

34:19.719 --> 34:21.920
Although the patient
was successfully resuscitated,

34:22.400 --> 34:24.400
she will remain vegetative
for the rest of her life.

34:25.679 --> 34:29.159
Is anyone willing to take care of her
for the rest of her life?

34:32.280 --> 34:33.159
There's one.

34:33.239 --> 34:34.840
This is Hann, Nanno's boyfriend.

34:35.560 --> 34:37.480
Yes, he is. They're so in love.

34:38.560 --> 34:40.320
He promised

34:41.080 --> 34:43.199
that he would never leave her.

34:44.679 --> 34:48.440
Forever and ever.

34:48.520 --> 34:54.000
Forever and ever.

34:54.080 --> 34:59.360
Forever and ever.

35:00.600 --> 35:02.160
Forever and ever.

35:05.520 --> 35:08.520
As my boyfriend,

35:08.600 --> 35:12.600
the first rule is,
"Don't you ever leave me."

35:13.200 --> 35:17.560
The second rule is also not to leave me.

35:17.640 --> 35:21.520
The third rule is still the same.

35:22.120 --> 35:27.960
Hanno.

35:28.080 --> 35:34.160
Hanno.

35:34.240 --> 35:35.760
Hanno.

35:36.560 --> 35:38.040
Hanno.

35:38.960 --> 35:40.360
Hanno.

35:41.200 --> 35:42.760
Hanno.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.840
Thank you so much

35:44.920 --> 35:48.960
for making me be with Hann forever.

35:49.760 --> 35:51.360
Hanno.

37:04.480 --> 37:06.480
Subtitle translation by Supanida H.
